# Stryker mutation testing: the HTML/JSON reports + the in-place backup/temp dir are build artifacts. The
# incremental report (reports/stryker-incremental.json) is the CI *cache* (ADR 0045 §4), restored via
# actions/cache — never committed.
reports/
.stryker-tmp/
# The vitest runner (10.x) copies its setup file into the cwd once per worker, `stryker-setup-<worker>.js` — with
# `inPlace` that is this package — and a worker killed on a timeout leaves its copy behind (measured 2026-11-07).
stryker-setup-*.js
